**File:** `components/screens-components/ai-chatbot.tsx:289–321`

```tsx
// PROBLEM — new onPress every render for each chip
{THINGS_I_CAN_DO.map((item) => (
  <AiChatSuggestionChip
    key={item.key}
    label={item.label}
    Icon={item.Icon}
    onPress={() => { void pushMessage(item.label); }}  // new ref every render
