**Files:**
- `search-catalogue.tsx:73` — `style={{ width: CARD_WIDTH }}` inside `.map()`
- `search-top-featured.tsx:45` — `style={{ width: '48%' }}` inside `.map()`

These objects are new references on every render. Extract as module-level constants.

```tsx
// search-catalogue.tsx — before map()
const CARD_STYLE = { width: CARD_WIDTH } as const;

// search-top-featured.tsx
const HALF_CARD_STYLE = { width: '48%' } as const;
